{%- comment -%}
  B2B price display -- single source of truth for how wholesale pricing is
  presented anywhere on the site.

  Two jobs, one file:

  1. style: 'inline' (default) -- a compact "RRP $x" line rendered under the
     price on every product card/grid site-wide. Hooked in from
     snippets/price.liquid, so it reaches collections, search, quickview,
     related products, sliders, etc. without touching each of those.

  2. style: 'box' -- the highlighted wholesale price box on the product page.
     Hooked in from the 'price' block in snippets/main-product-blocks.liquid.
     The theme's own price markup is passed in as `price_html` and rendered
     inside the box unchanged, so sale/sold-out badges, unit pricing and the
     f-price classes the theme's JS looks for all survive.

  Nothing here calculates a discount. A wholesaler's price is already the
  B2B catalog price Shopify resolved server-side -- this only adds the RRP
  alongside it.

  Who sees it: company contacts only (`customer.b2b?`). Deliberately NOT the
  `customer.tags contains 'b2b'` fallback the rest of the theme uses -- a
  tagged customer with no company still pays retail, so showing them an RRP
  comparison would be wrong. Change the one assignment below if that needs
  to widen, or narrow it later to GVM-approved companies only.

  RRP source: the custom.rrp metafield (Money) first, falling back to the
  variant's compare_at_price when it is higher than what they pay -- so
  products that have not had RRP filled in yet still show something.

  Accepts:
  - product:     {Object} required
  - target:      {Object} product or variant the displayed price came from (optional)
  - style:       {String} 'inline' (default) or 'box'
  - price_html:  {String} captured theme price markup, required for style: 'box'
  - hide_saving: {Boolean} drop the "You save" line. Used by sections that swap
                 the price client-side (ori-gvm-product), where a server-rendered
                 saving would go stale as soon as the shopper changes variant.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign b2b_price_visible = false
  if customer.b2b?
    assign b2b_price_visible = true
  endif

  if target == blank
    assign target = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  endif

  assign current_price = target.price | default: product.price

  comment
    A Money metafield already coerces to cents in arithmetic -- the same unit
    every storefront price uses -- so it needs no conversion. Multiplying by
    100 here inflated $32,999 to $3,299,900.
  endcomment
  assign rrp_cents = 0
  assign rrp_metafield = product.metafields.custom.rrp.value
  if rrp_metafield != blank
    assign rrp_cents = rrp_metafield | times: 1 | round
  elsif target.compare_at_price > current_price
    assign rrp_cents = target.compare_at_price
  endif

  assign money_rrp = rrp_cents | money
  if settings.currency_code_enabled
    assign money_rrp = rrp_cents | money_with_currency
  endif

  assign saving_cents = rrp_cents | minus: current_price
  assign saving_percent = 0
  if rrp_cents > 0 and saving_cents > 0
    assign saving_percent = saving_cents | times: 100 | divided_by: rrp_cents
  endif
  assign money_saving = saving_cents | money

  assign has_rrp = false
  if b2b_price_visible and rrp_cents > 0
    assign has_rrp = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if style == 'box' -%}
  {%- if b2b_price_visible -%}
    <div class="gvm-b2b-pricebox{% unless has_rrp %} gvm-b2b-pricebox--no-rrp{% endunless %}">
      <span class="gvm-b2b-pricebox__label">Your wholesale price</span>
      <div class="gvm-b2b-pricebox__price">
        {{ price_html }}
      </div>
      {%- if has_rrp -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Not struck through: RRP is the price this wholesaler sells the
          product on at, not a was-price they are being discounted from.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="gvm-b2b-pricebox__rrp">
          <span class="gvm-b2b-pricebox__rrp-label">Suggested retail (RRP)</span>
          <span class="gvm-b2b-pricebox__rrp-value">{{ money_rrp }}</span>
          {%- if saving_percent > 0 and hide_saving != true -%}
            <span class="gvm-b2b-pricebox__saving">
              Margin {{ money_saving }} ({{ saving_percent }}%)
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    {{ price_html }}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- elsif has_rrp -%}
  <div class="gvm-rrp">
    <span class="gvm-rrp__badge">
      <span class="gvm-rrp__label">RRP</span>
      <span class="gvm-rrp__value">{{ money_rrp }}</span>
    </span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
